### MediTriaje 2.0 — Colección de Pruebas HTTP (Fase M3: Administración y Catálogos)
### Compatible con REST Client (VS Code, IntelliJ, etc.)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@csrfHeader = X-Requested-With
@csrfValue = XMLHttpRequest

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Healthcheck Técnico
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name ping
GET {{baseUrl}}/ping
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Login como Administrador (ROLE_ADMINISTRADOR)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
{{csrfHeader}}: {{csrfValue}}

{
  "email": "admin@meditriaje.com",
  "password": "Admin12345*"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. CRUD de Especialidades (HU-10)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name crearEspecialidad
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/specialties
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
{{csrfHeader}}: {{csrfValue}}

{
  "nombre": "Cardiologia",
  "duracionSlotMin": 30
}

### Listar especialidades (paginado)
# @name listarEspecialidades
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/specialties?page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json

### Consultar especialidad por publicId
# @name consultarEspecialidad
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/specialties/esp-medicina-general-001
Accept: application/json

### Actualizar especialidad
# @name actualizarEspecialidad
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/specialties/esp-medicina-general-001
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
{{csrfHeader}}: {{csrfValue}}

{
  "nombre": "Medicina General Integral",
  "duracionSlotMin": 25
}

### Desactivar especialidad (Soft delete)
# @name desactivarEspecialidad
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/specialties/esp-medicina-general-001/deactivate
Accept: application/json
{{csrfHeader}}: {{csrfValue}}

### Reactivar especialidad
# @name reactivarEspecialidad
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/specialties/esp-medicina-general-001/activate
Accept: application/json
{{csrfHeader}}: {{csrfValue}}

